<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3648/53  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7048/55  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9170/75  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4645/55  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.19/20   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7470/00  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1695.5/6.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     123.31/36  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6967/42  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.8430/80  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5105/35  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4340/50  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7936/41  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7440/45  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5969/76</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$353.10/353.60</p>
</text>
